    <article class="timeline-item"><button class="timeline-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="chapter">03</span><span class="timeline-title"><strong>Software Engineer</strong><small>Jan 2024 — Jul 2025</small></span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="timeline-body"><p>Built AI security assistants, autonomous code remediation, rollback-safe cloud workflows, scalable reporting, scanner ingestion, and enterprise dashboard infrastructure.</p></div></article>
    <article class="timeline-item"><button class="timeline-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="chapter">02</span><span class="timeline-title"><strong>Junior Software Engineer</strong><small>Apr 2022 — Dec 2023</small></span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="timeline-body"><p>Optimized bulk operations and API performance, designed audit history and archival systems, and shipped workflow integrations across a multi-tenant security platform.</p></div></article>
    <article class="timeline-item"><button class="timeline-trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="chapter">01</span><span class="timeline-title"><strong>Software Engineering Intern</strong><small>Nov 2021 — Mar 2022</small></span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="timeline-body"><p>Started with production backend development across Python, Django, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, and Docker—and learned to treat reliability as a product feature.</p></div></article>
